1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:02,961
All the articles
were sorted out

2
00:00:05,047 --> 00:00:06,047
Yeah

3
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:09,968
His agency worked hard

4
00:00:11,595 --> 00:00:13,597
Their damage might be
more serious than us

5
00:00:16,516 --> 00:00:18,018
How have you been?

6
00:00:21,271 --> 00:00:22,271
I just…

7
00:00:23,857 --> 00:00:25,859
monitored the dramas

8
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:29,947
And… I'm moving out

9
00:00:30,072 --> 00:00:31,490
You're moving?

10
00:00:31,615 --> 00:00:33,283
Yes

11
00:00:33,408 --> 00:00:34,826
My rent contract
is expiring soon

12
00:00:34,952 --> 00:00:36,620
and I found a house
in a good location

13
00:00:38,914 --> 00:00:40,249
I'm sorry, Soobin

14
00:00:44,086 --> 00:00:45,170
You know what?

15
00:00:47,339 --> 00:00:48,339
You were the only one

16
00:00:50,717 --> 00:00:51,717
who I liked in my life

17
00:00:58,267 --> 00:00:59,393
Still, I have to say this

18
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:01,972
Don't see Shin Yoo-il
anymore

19
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:04,982
Being with him
puts you in danger

20
00:01:07,985 --> 00:01:10,028
It's not easy to have
a fake relationship

21
00:01:10,153 --> 00:01:12,322
and coming out
is not either

22
00:01:12,447 --> 00:01:13,967
Shin Yoo-il was willing
to take that risk

23
00:01:13,991 --> 00:01:15,784
only if he'd go viral
in the first place

24
00:01:16,868 --> 00:01:18,787
If necessary, he could
cancel that contract

25
00:01:20,205 --> 00:01:21,832
and leave you any time

26
00:01:24,084 --> 00:01:25,084
Hyesung

27
00:01:26,962 --> 00:01:28,839
I don't want you
to get hurt

28
00:01:31,591 --> 00:01:32,591
I'm saying this

29
00:01:34,386 --> 00:01:35,846
as your friend
